{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方两行浅紫色大字，先看到“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”，再看到“一阵心慌”。下方金色音符动画也较亮，但文字标题更有阅读入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"舍不得放下曾经被当作自己人的那段日子，具体此刻发生了什么还不清楚。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、惶然。\",\n  \"missed\": \"那扇门再次出现，重新面对过去那个不知所措的自己；问题仍没有简单答案。右上角关于离开后的空落、思念被现实刺痛、答案悬而未决的阶段信息也没有第一眼抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"主标题是文学化的概括表达，能传递大致处境，但具体触发事件不明确，需要再看正文。\",\n    \"正文连续呈现多个层次的信息，心慌的具体缘由和过去与现在的关系需要进一步阅读才能理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3bfff2cc-058a-47e0-a235-022a2457e266", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022729465978Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:28:27.481576+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8506c0a14f660ad6b6610510b0b56e0df21e4c76c59cff5fbfdf953c213e11f6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_